OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FBecoming windy with a risk of
OL,6,Fgales. A mostly cloudy day with some
OL,7,Foutbreaks of rain, mainly in the west.
OL,8,FRain spreading further eastwards later.
OL,9,
OL,10,CTonight:FIt will be cloudy in the
OL,11,Fevening and overnight with rain
OL,12,Fspreading southeastwards and becoming
OL,13,Fheavy at times. Strong winds through
OL,14,Fthe evening but easing overnight.
OL,15,
OL,16,CThursday:FAny lingering rain clearing
OL,17,Fto the southeast in the morning.
OL,18,FMostly dry in the afternoon with just
OL,19,Fthe odd shower possible in the west
OL,20,Fand brighter spells developing. Light
OL,21,Fwinds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
